

# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary, max 72 chars, no period>
#
# <body: what changed and WHY, wrapped at ~72 chars, bullets ok>
#
# <footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ... | Refs #123 | Co-Authored-By: ...>
#
# Types : feat fix docs test refactor perf style build ci chore
# Scopes: engine store ui scan data llm readme docs deps
#
# Example:
#   fix(scan): stop camera once and read GPS per scan
#
# One concern per commit. Before committing, from scanguard-system/:
#   npx tsc -b && npm test && npm run lint
# See CONTRIBUTING.md for details. Lines starting with # are ignored.
